  "Name": "Ivanti Avalanche FileStoreConfig File Upload",
  "Description": "Ivanti Avalanche prior to v6.4.0.186 permits MS-DOS style short names in the configuration path for the Central FileStore. Because of this, an administrator can change the default path to the web root of the applications, upload a JSP file, and achieve RCE as NT AUTHORITY\\SYSTEM.",
